й","nl":"onzichtbaar","pl":"niewidzialny, niewidoczny","de":"unsichtbar","fr":"invisible","it":"invisibile","cs":"neviditelný","tr":"görünmez, görünmeyen","es":"invisible"}},{"w":"legendary","d":"Described in or based on old stories and legends rather than historical facts.","t":{"ru":"легендарный","nl":"legendarisch","pl":"legendarny","de":"legendär, sagenumwoben, mythisch","fr":"légendaire, mythique","it":"leggendario","cs":"legendární, bájný","tr":"efsanevi, destansı","es":"legendario"}},{"w":"magical","d":"Relating to or produced by magic or supernatural forces.","t":{"ru":"маги́ческий, волше́бный","nl":"magisch, tovenaars-","pl":"magiczny, czarodziejski","de":"magisch, zauberhaft","fr":"magique, féerique","it":"magico, incantato","cs":"magický, kouzelný","tr":"sihirli, büyülü, büyüsel","es":"mágico"}},{"w":"mischief","d":"Conduct that playfully causes petty annoyance.","t":{"ru":"озорство, шалость, баловство","nl":"kattenkwaad, ondeugendheid, stoutigheid","pl":"psoty, szelmostwo, swawola","de":"Unfug, Schabernack, Neckerei","fr":"espièglerie, malice, bêtise","it":"monelleria, birichinata, malizia","cs":"nezbednost, neplecha, darebáctví","tr":"yaramazlık, muzırlık, haşarılık","es":"travesura, diablura, picardía"}},{"w":"monster","d":"A terrifying and dangerous creature, especially one of an imaginary or mythical kind.","t":{"ru":"чудовище, монстр, чудище","nl":"monster, gedrocht","pl":"potwór, monstrum, bestia","de":"Monster, Ungeheuer","fr":"monstre","it":"mostro","cs":"příšera, nestvůra, monstrum","tr":"canavar, canavar, öcü","es":"monstruo, bestia"}},{"w":"owl","d":"A nocturnal bird of prey with large eyes, a flat face, and a hooked beak.","t":{"ru":"сова, филин, сыч","nl":"uil","pl":"sowa, puchacz, pójdźka","de":"Eule, Uhu, Eulenvogel","fr":"hibou, chouette","it":"gufo, civetta, allocco","cs":"sova, výr, sýček","tr":"baykuş, puhu","es":"búho, lechuza, tecolote"}},{"w":"portrait","d":"A painting, photograph, drawing, or other artistic representation of a person, usually showing the face and shoulders.","t":{"ru":"портрет","nl":"portret","pl":"portret","de":"Porträt, Portrait, Bildnis","fr":"portrait","it":"ritratto","cs":"portrét, podobizna","tr":"portre","es":"retrato"}},{"w":"potion","d":"A small dose of a liquid that is medicinal, poisonous, or magical.","t":{"ru":"зелье, снадобье, напиток","nl":"toverdrank, drankje, toverdrankje","pl":"eliksir, mikstura, napój","de":"Trank, Zaubertrank, Elixier","fr":"potion, philtre, breuvage","it":"pozione, filtro","cs":"lektvar, nápoj, medicína","tr":"iksir, posyon, ilaç","es":"poción, pócima, brebaje"}},{"w":"prefect","d":"A senior pupil in a school who is given certain powers of discipline and responsibility over other students.","t":{"ru":"староста, префект","nl":"prefect, klassenoudste","pl":"dyżurny, gospodarz klasy, prefekt","de":"Präfekt, Klassensprecher, Schulsprecher","fr":"préfet, délégué de classe","it":"capoclasse, prefetto","cs":"prefekt, starosta","tr":"mümessil, sınıf başkanı, prefekt","es":"prefecto, monitor, delegado"}},{"w":"prophecy","d":"A statement about what is going to happen in the future, often believed to be sent by a god or made by a person with special powers.","t":{"ru":"пророчество, предсказание","nl":"profetie, voorspelling","pl":"proroctwo, przepowiednia","de":"Prophezeiung, Weissagung, Vorhersage","fr":"prophétie, prédiction","it":"profezia, predizione","cs":"proroctví, předpověď","tr":"kehanet, öngörü","es":"profecía, predicción"}},{"w":"rat","d":"A medium-sized rodent belonging to the genus Rattus, usually distinguished from mice by its larger size.","t":{"ru":"крыса, пасюк","nl":"rat, bruine rat, zwarte rat","pl":"szczur","de":"Ratte, Ratz","fr":"rat, surmulot","it":"ratto, topo, sorcio","cs":"krysa, potkan","tr":"sıçan, fare, keme","es":"rata"}},{"w":"snake","d":"A long, legless reptile with a thin body and a forked tongue.","t":{"ru":"змея","nl":"slang, serpent","pl":"wąż","de":"Schlange","fr":"serpent","it":"serpente, serpe, biscia","cs":"ha