ait for and get on or off trains.","t":{"ru":"платформа, перрон","nl":"perron","pl":"peron, platforma","de":"Bahnsteig, Perron, Gleis","fr":"quai, voie","it":"binario, banchina","cs":"nástupiště, perón","tr":"peron, platform","es":"andén, plataforma"}},{"w":"express","d":"A train or bus that travels quickly to a destination, making few or no stops.","t":{"ru":"экспресс, скорый поезд","nl":"sneltrein, expresstrein","pl":"ekspres, pociąg pospieszny","de":"Expresszug, Schnellzug, Express","fr":"express, rapide","it":"espresso","cs":"expres, rychlík","tr":"ekspres, hızlı tren","es":"exprés, expreso"}},{"w":"carriage","d":"A separate section of a train where passengers sit.","t":{"ru":"вагон","nl":"wagon, rijtuig","pl":"wagon","de":"Waggon, Wagen, Personenwagen","fr":"wagon, voiture","it":"vagone, carrozza","cs":"vagón, vůz","tr":"vagon","es":"vagón, coche"}},{"w":"horcrux","d":"In the Harry Potter series, a magical object in which a wizard has concealed a part of their soul to achieve immortality.","t":{"ru":"крестраж","nl":"gruzielement","pl":"horkruks","de":"Horkrux","fr":"horcruxe","it":"Horcrux","cs":"viteál","tr":"hortkuluk","es":"horrocrux"}}]